msgctxt "app name"
msgid "Online booking"
msgstr "Reservas online"

# The app's name as the store reads it (base.catalog looks the plain msgid up in this catalogue). In the
# merged catalogue of the running Hub, Citas comes first and keeps «Reserva online» for a booking's origin.
msgid "Online booking"
msgstr "Reservas online"

msgid ""
"Let customers book themselves online, and confirm or cancel their bookings "
"from one inbox."
msgstr ""
"Deja que tus clientes reserven solos por internet, y confirma o cancela sus "
"reservas desde una sola bandeja."

msgid ""
"Online booking is your booking page: customers pick a service, a "
"professional or anyone free, a day and a free time, leave their name and "
"mobile, and the booking goes straight into your diary, confirmed or waiting "
"for you to confirm it. Their link lets them see and cancel it within your "
"cancellation policy. From the inbox you confirm, complete, mark no-shows and "
"cancel; in the settings you choose the page's texts and colours, the booking "
"rules and which services can be booked online."
msgstr ""
"Reservas online es tu página de reservas: tus clientes eligen un servicio, "
"un profesional o el primero libre, un día y una hora libre, dejan su nombre "
"y su móvil, y la reserva entra directamente en tu agenda, confirmada o "
"esperando a que la confirmes. Con su enlace la ven y la cancelan dentro de tu "
"política de cancelación. Desde la bandeja confirmas, completas, marcas las "
"ausencias y cancelas; en los ajustes eliges los textos y colores de la "
"página, las reglas de reserva y qué servicios se reservan online."

